⍝ CompressAxis.tc
⍝ ═══════════════

⍝@ test4.

      ⎕IO←1

      ⍝ Precond: LO Boolean; Z nonscalar
      ⍝ inv: ¯1↓⍴Z ←→ ¯1↓⍴B  (along selected axis, others unchanged)
      ⍝ inv: ⍴⍴Z ←→ ⍴⍴B
      B ← ⎕RVAL 2 (4 5) (,0 1 0 0 0)
      LO ← 2∣|⎕RVAL 1 (,4) (,0 1 0 0 0)     ⍝ compress along axis 1
      Z ← LO/[1]B
      (⍴⍴Z) ≡ ⍴⍴B
1
      ⍝ Axes other than selected are unchanged
      ((⍴Z)[2]) ≡ (⍴B)[2]
1
